# PredictIQ - Equipment Intelligence Platform

An enterprise-style predictive maintenance and AI-powered
equipment intelligence platform.

## Technology Stack

- Databricks
- PySpark
- Delta Lake
- Unity Catalog
- Python
- Scikit-learn
- XGBoost
- PyTorch
- MLflow
- React
- Node.js
- PostgreSQL
- Generative AI
- RAG

## Project Objectives

1. Build an end-to-end data engineering pipeline.
2. Implement Bronze, Silver and Gold architecture.
3. Train equipment failure prediction models.
4. Implement anomaly detection.
5. Predict Remaining Useful Life (RUL).
6. Implement Generative AI and RAG.
7. Build an enterprise-style application.

## Initial Dataset

AI4I 2020 Predictive Maintenance Dataset

Source:
https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/601/ai4i+2020+predictive+maintenance+dataset
EOF